\v 1 \add Finally\add* when¦231529 the 13th of March arrived, it was time for everyone to do what the letters from the king¦231533 said that he had¦231538 decreed for them¦231542 to do. The¦231536 enemies of the Jews had expected to destroy the Jews on¦231518 that¦231521 day¦231527 but¦231518 just the opposite happened—instead, it was¦231543 the¦231547 Jews who¦231549 destroyed their¦231549 enemies.
