\v 16 The¦231801 Jews¦231802 in¦231804 the other parts of the empire, who¦231803 had gathered¦231806 together to fight for their lives¦231811 had defeated their enemies and¦231801 killed¦231814 75,000 of¦231815 them¦231815. But¦231801 they¦231821 \add too\add* did¦231808 not¦231820 take the things that¦231815 had belonged to their¦231824 enemies.
