\v 21 That decree established an annual holiday on¦231913 the¦231920 14th and¦231922 15th of¦231923 March every¦231928 year¦231930,\f + \fr 9:21 \ft The OET-RV gives an approximate time of the year in our calendars, but the Jewish calendar is largely a lunar calendar so the dates of the feast in our calendars moves around a little. In 2024 for example, ‘Purim’ begins on the evening of March 23 in Yisrael/Israel and concludes at sundown on March 24.\f*
