\v 26 Therefore¦232025 they called¦232028 this¦232045 celebration ‘Purim¦232031’\f + \fr 9:26 \ft Plural of Hebrew ‘Pur’ meaning ‘lot/dice’.\f* because of what¦232046 they¦232048 had¦232048 experienced¦232048 and¦232052 because of the¦232030 contents¦232043 of¦232043 \add Mordekai's\add* letter¦232044.
