\v 3 Mordekai¦232228 the¦232229 Jew¦232229 was¦232230 second-in-command¦232230 to the¦232231 king¦232231 Ahasuerus¦232232, and¦232233 a leader among¦232234 the Jews¦232234. He¦232238 was popular¦232235 with most of¦232240 his own people¦232240, seeking¦232238 good¦232239 for¦232231 them and teaching all¦232243 his descendants \add how to live in\add* peace¦232242.
